{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria, haven't talked for a few days. Had a wild week, my car broke down last Fri on my way to work. Trying to get it fixed but it's tough & putting a strain on my wallet. Staying positive & looking for a solution though."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-2c18c37932e200928c5aa496", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.208700+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2c18c37932e200928c5aa496", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2c18c37932e200928c5aa496", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Aww John, bummer about that. No doubt it's been tough, but I'm impressed by how positive you're being. Keep it up - tough times pass, but you're tough enough to get through 'em!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-3c323507c2980c302151ab6b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.235551+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3c323507c2980c302151ab6b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3c323507c2980c302151ab6b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria. Your kind words mean a lot. Yeah, it's been tough with car trouble and money problems, but I stay positive and find a way. This picture reminds me of a road trip we took last year; even with bumps along the way, there's still beauty and hope."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-64539a3807add4f1d9b7816e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.244277+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "64539a3807add4f1d9b7816e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "64539a3807add4f1d9b7816e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, great pic! Where did you go on that road trip?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-bd78c024e1f4850daf0fb2da", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.264703+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bd78c024e1f4850daf0fb2da", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bd78c024e1f4850daf0fb2da", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! We explored the coast up in the Pacific Northwest and hit some cool national parks. The beauty of nature was absolutely breathtaking!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-1668e099be703cb2c1af67e9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.275362+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1668e099be703cb2c1af67e9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1668e099be703cb2c1af67e9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, that must've been great! It's so nice to appreciate nature and find peace. Lucky you got to experience that."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-c75f645f1a72e7d2892b304a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.287013+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c75f645f1a72e7d2892b304a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c75f645f1a72e7d2892b304a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, it was amazing. The stunning views really make you think."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-f18ef68288d8ff27f6b01b14", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.301428+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f18ef68288d8ff27f6b01b14", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f18ef68288d8ff27f6b01b14", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Nature helps put things in perspective and reminds us of the beauty even during tough times. Hold onto those moments of peace."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-73b9b776da590b4c6dd89b2e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.312863+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "73b9b776da590b4c6dd89b2e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "73b9b776da590b4c6dd89b2e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, Maria. That peace and beauty are so needed, especially during tough times. They give us the power and inspiration to continue. Anything cool you're up to now?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-a59bc584e984be6e046d6d2b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.323903+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a59bc584e984be6e046d6d2b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a59bc584e984be6e046d6d2b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: I recently gave a few talks at the homeless shelter I volunteer at. It was really fulfilling and I received lots of compliments from other volunteers. It was a great reminder about why connecting with and helping others is so important. And, I bought a cross necklace to feel closer to my faith- which has made me happy."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-1b14f5a997e24cc5c57a4ecc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.334183+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1b14f5a997e24cc5c57a4ecc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1b14f5a997e24cc5c57a4ecc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Way to go, Maria! You're making a real difference. It's awesome how connecting with and helping others brings you so much joy. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-85be6c9a6867abcf7b5e3a3a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.348068+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "85be6c9a6867abcf7b5e3a3a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "85be6c9a6867abcf7b5e3a3a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! It's so great to make a real difference. Seeing the impact and hearing the gratitude fills me with so much joy. The people at the shelter have become like family to me. I feel really blessed to know them."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-c0d369858400f2c9ec360088", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.362128+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c0d369858400f2c9ec360088", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c0d369858400f2c9ec360088", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria, what you're doing is truly amazing. Your kindness ripples and creates such incredible relationships!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-295f59e8f0747f8a1a8b1532", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.375389+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "295f59e8f0747f8a1a8b1532", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "295f59e8f0747f8a1a8b1532", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John. Building relationships and seeing kindness really does make a difference. Here's a pic from last week. Seeing everyone come together warms my heart and fills me with hope."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-9d1f300271f08fd704bded2c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.388170+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9d1f300271f08fd704bded2c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9d1f300271f08fd704bded2c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, that's amazing how everyone came together. You must have had some great ideas! What do you do there?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-d87831f1f954568d336918f9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.399339+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d87831f1f954568d336918f9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d87831f1f954568d336918f9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: We organized a meal for the shelter residents and I helped with getting everything ready. It was cool to see everyone together, eating and supporting each other."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-33582251766f9550ccaa0ee3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.410528+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "33582251766f9550ccaa0ee3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "33582251766f9550ccaa0ee3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria, that's awesome! You made everyone so comfortable and it must have been so rewarding. You're really making a difference!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-e40c191575b10cbf517f5b92", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.425395+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e40c191575b10cbf517f5b92", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e40c191575b10cbf517f5b92", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, it was really nice to help bring people together and create a sense of comfort and community. It's something special to see people supporting each other."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-97b77faa92c05e0b56483d28", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.438391+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "97b77faa92c05e0b56483d28", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "97b77faa92c05e0b56483d28", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Definitely, Maria. That's great. It gives us hope and reminds us we're not alone. Thank you for being a positive force."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-2aa47d2ed72f69ca01e9b14f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.449458+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2aa47d2ed72f69ca01e9b14f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2aa47d2ed72f69ca01e9b14f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: No problem, John! It's great to feel this sense of community. Thanks for the kind words, they mean a lot."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-d65c9eafb1893518976c1833", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.459354+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d65c9eafb1893518976c1833", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d65c9eafb1893518976c1833", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Glad I could help, Maria. Talk to you soon. Stay safe!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_11-b3b67cc70433793b1ff263d1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:26:55.473082+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b3b67cc70433793b1ff263d1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b3b67cc70433793b1ff263d1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
